# Complete semantic translation of the historical combined usbsacm.wlcmd.
#
# Native locklint recognizes historical and pseudo-kernel entry points through
# external linkage, escaped function pointers, and resolved calls.  The
# ds_ops and registered callback calls remain explicit indirect calls, while
# all in-module targets remain reachable through their escaped addresses.
#
# Neither historical "one" declaration affects corrected OSLL output.
#
# The runner normalizes documented multiline anchors, OSLL's duplicate
# adjacent usbser port_state read, and native's additional adjacent
# acm_ctrl_if_no store before comparing exact source/member pairs.
